OL,3,GNEWSASchool car park could be bought by
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car park used by staff and visitors
OL,7,Fto a primary school could be bought by
OL,8,Fa local authority for #325,000.
OL,10,FPeterborough City Council has leased
OL,11,Fthe parking area for The Beeches
OL,12,FPrimary School, for 15 years, but the
OL,13,Flease has expired without a right to
OL,14,Frenew.
OL,16,FThe council will now consider whether
OL,17,Fto buy the land to ensure school users
OL,18,Fcan still park there as there is no
OL,19,Fsuitable alternative nearby.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
